#: include/global_form.php:172
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Marudio ya Juu ya Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php:173
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Kwa Vifaa vya SNMPv2 na SNMPv3, ukubwa wa max-repetitions wa SNMP Bulk Walk. Chaguomsingi ni 'Gundua Kiotomatiki wakati wa Kufahirisi Tena'. Kwa swichi kubwa sana, seva za utendakazi wa juu, Mitandao ya Jumbo Frame au kwa miunganisho ya WAN yenye kuchelewa kwingi, kuongeza thamani hii kunaweza kuongeza utendakazi wa poller. Data zaidi huwekwa kwenye pakiti moja ya SNMP jambo ambalo linaweza kupunguza muda wa kuendesha hoja ya data. Hata hivyo, baadhi ya vifaa vinaweza kukataa kabisa kujibu pakiti zenye ukubwa wa max-repetition uliowekwa kuwa mkubwa mno. Hii inaweza kuwa kweli hasa kwa vifaa vya aina ya IoT vyenye nguvu ndogo au vifaa vidogo vilivyopachikwa vya IT. Tahadhari maalum kwa MTU ya njia nzima ya mtandao inapaswa pia kuzingatiwa kwani kuweka thamani kubwa mno kunaweza kusababisha kugawanyika kwa pakiti."

