#: include/global_settings.php:427
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Mbinu ya Ruhusa za Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php:428
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kuna mbinu nne za kubainisha Ruhusa za Grafu za Mtumiaji.  Ya kwanza ni 'Inayoruhusu' (Permissive).  Chini ya mpangilio wa 'Inayoruhusu', Mtumiaji anahitaji tu ufikiaji wa aidha Grafu, Kifaa au Kiolezo cha Grafu ili kupata ufikiaji wa Grafu zinazohusika nazo.  Chini ya 'Inayozuia' (Restrictive), Mtumiaji lazima awe na ufikiaji wa Grafu, Kifaa, na Kiolezo cha Grafu ili kupata ufikiaji wa Grafu.  Mbinu hizi mbili za kwanza zina matatizo ya ukuaji kwa usakinishaji mkubwa sana.  Hivyo, chaguo mbili za ziada zinapatikana.  Nazo ni 'Inayotegemea Kifaa' (Device Based), inayomaanisha kuwa ukiwa na ufikiaji wa Kifaa, unapata ufikiaji wa Grafu zake.  Na mwisho 'Inayotegemea Kiolezo cha Grafu' (Graph Template Based), inayomaanisha kuwa ukiwa na ufikiaji wa 'Kiolezo cha Grafu' unapata ufikiaji wa Grafu zote za Kifaa za Kiolezo hicho."

#: include/global_settings.php:432
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Inayoruhusu"

#: include/global_settings.php:433
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Inayozuia"

#: include/global_settings.php:434
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Kulingana na Kifaa"

#: include/global_settings.php:440
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Mbinu ya Uundaji wa Grafu/Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php:441
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa Rahisi, Grafu na Vyanzo vya Data vinaweza kuundwa kutoka Grafu Mpya pekee. Ikiwa ni ya Kina, uundaji wa zamani wa Grafu na Chanzo cha Data unaungwa mkono."

#: include/global_settings.php:444
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Rahisi"

#: include/global_settings.php:445 lib/html.php:2948
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Kina"

#: include/global_settings.php:449
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Onyesha Usaidizi wa Fomu/Mipangilio Ndani ya Mstari"

#: include/global_settings.php:450
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, Usaidizi wa Fomu na Mipangilio utaonyeshwa ndani ya mstari.  Vinginevyo utaonyeshwa unapoelea juu ya kitufe cha usaidizi."

#: include/global_settings.php:455
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa Ukurasa wa Ndani Pekee"

#: include/global_settings.php:456
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Kwa chaguomsingi usaidizi wa ukurasa wa Cacti uko katika docs.cacti.net. Hata hivyo, ikiwa mfumo wako hauna ufikiaji wa Mtandao, unaweza kupakua nyaraka ndani ya mfumo katika umbizo la HTML na kuziweka katika eneo la 'docs' la seva yako ya Cacti. Ukichagua kutumia eneo la ndani pekee kwa nyaraka za usaidizi wa ukurasa, weka tiki kwenye kisanduku hiki."

#: include/global_settings.php:461
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa Kufuta"

#: include/global_settings.php:462
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Uliza mtumiaji kabla ya kufuta kipengee."

#: include/global_settings.php:467
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Mpangilio Awali wa Uhifadhi wa Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_settings.php:468
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Ikiwezeshwa, Cacti itaweka Kitufe cha Redio kufuta Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana vya Grafu unapoondoa Grafu.  Kumbuka: Cacti haitaruhusu uondoaji wa Vyanzo vya Data ikiwa vinatumika katika Grafu nyingine."

#: include/global_settings.php:473
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Kufungua Grafu Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:474
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Ikiwezeshwa, Cacti haitafunga Grafu.  Hii huruhusu marekebisho ya haraka ya mkono ya Vyanzo vya Data vinavyohusiana na Grafu."

#: include/global_settings.php:479
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Ficha Dashibodi ya Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php:480
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Kwa matumizi na Usaidizi wa Viungo vya Nje vya Cacti. Kwa kutumia mpangilio huu, unaweza kuficha Dashibodi ya Cacti, ili uweze kuonyesha ukurasa wako mwenyewe tu."

#: include/global_settings.php:485
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Wezesha Buruta-na-Dondosha"

#: include/global_settings.php:486
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Baadhi ya violesura vya Cacti vinaauni Buruta-na-Udondoshe.  Ikiteuliwa chaguo hili litawezeshwa.  Kumbuka: Kwa mtumiaji mwenye matatizo ya kuona, chaguo hili linaweza kuzimwa."

#: include/global_settings.php:491
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Usalama wa Eneo"

#: include/global_settings.php:496
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Lazimisha Miunganisho kupitia HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php:497
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, majaribio yoyote ya kufikia Cacti yataelekezwa upya kwenda HTTPS ili kuhakikisha usalama wa juu."

#: include/global_settings.php:502
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Ruhusu HTTPS Isiyo Salama kwa Kikusanya Data cha Mbali"

#: include/global_settings.php:503
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ruhusu matumizi ya Vyeti Vilivyosainiwa Kibinafsi na ruhusu jina la kipangishi la Cheti kutofautiana na lile la Kikusanya Data cha Mbali."

#: include/global_settings.php:508
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Ruhusu Vibambo vya Meta Visivyo Salama katika Mbinu za Kuingiza Data"

#: include/global_settings.php:509
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Kihistoria, wasimamizi wa Cacti waliunda Mbinu rahisi za Kuingiza Data ambazo zinajumuisha amri kama \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" ili kuwakilisha thamani ya nambari kwa matumizi katika Grafu za Cacti. Katika matoleo ya awali ya Cacti, hii iliruhusiwa. Hata hivyo, hili ni jambo lisilo salama kwani ni mlango kwa watumiaji wengine kuchapisha Violezo vya Data visivyo salama. Katika Cacti ya kisasa, mbinu za aina hii zinapaswa kuepukwa. Hata hivyo, tunatoa chaguo hili ikiwa una Mbinu za zamani za Kuingiza Data ambazo zina Vibambo hivi vya Meta Visivyo Salama na hujazigeuza kuwa hati za ndani katika saraka ya 'scripts'. Wakati chaguo hili halijatiwa tiki, Cacti huzuia vibambo vya meta vya mtindo wa shell kama vile alama za nukuu, mabano yaliyopinda, mistari wima, mikwaju ya nyuma, na alama za nyuma. Cacti inaendelea kuruhusu alama za kubwa-kuliko na ndogo-kuliko kwa vitu kama <path_cacti> na kwa vigezo vya ingizo, lakini ikiwa chaguo hili halijatiwa tiki, huo ndio kikomo cha matumizi yake yanayoruhusiwa."

#: include/global_settings.php:515
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Sera ya Hati ya Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php:516
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Hudhibiti sera ya CSP ya script-src. Katika Hali za Nonce, Programu-jalizi za Cacti zinazotumia JavaScript ya ndani lazima zijumuishe sifa ya nonce kutoka kwa kitendakazi cha ndani cha Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Vinginevyo, hati hizo zitazuiwa na kivinjari. Kwa sasa, Cacti inaruhusu tu kuripoti kuhusu Programu-jalizi za Cacti ambazo hazitumii ipasavyo Hali ya Nonce. Katika siku zijazo, tutawaruhusu Wasimamizi kuzuia programu-jalizi kama hizo kutumia JavaScript yao ya ndani ikiwa hazitumii Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php:519
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Ruhusu JavaScript ya Ndani Isiyo na Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:520
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Ruhusu unsafe-eval na JavaScript ya Ndani Isiyo na Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:521
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Hali ya Nonce - Kuripoti Pekee"

#: include/global_settings.php:525 include/global_settings.php:540
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI ya Ripoti ya Ukiukaji wa CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php:526
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ambapo vivinjari hutuma ripoti za ukiukaji wa CSP kwa njia ya POST katika hali za nonce-report na nonce. Acha wazi ili kutumia <url_path>/csp_report.php. Ni lazima iwe na herufi salama za URL pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php:532
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Vyanzo Mbadala vya Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php:533
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Majina ya vikoa yaliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi yatakayoruhusiwa kufikiwa nje ya Seva ya Wavuti yenyewe.  Hii ni muhimu kwa watumiaji wanaochagua kutumia CDN, au tovuti ya mwenyeji.  Vyanzo vinaweza kujumuisha kadi-mwitu kwa mfano: *.mydomain.com, au itifaki, kwa mfano: https://*.example.com.  Vyanzo hivi Mbadala vinajumuisha aina za Picha, CSS na JavaScript pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php:541
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ambapo vivinjari hutuma ripoti za ukiukaji wa CSP kwa njia ya POST katika hali za nonce-report na nonce. Acha wazi ili kutumia /cacti/csp_report.php katika mzizi wa usakinishaji. Ni lazima iwe na herufi salama za URL pekee."

#: include/global_settings.php:553
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Wezesha Uundaji wa Grafu Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:554
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ikizimwa, Otomatiki ya Cacti haitaunda Grafu yoyote kikamilifu.  Hii ni muhimu unaporekebisha mipangilio ya Kifaa ili kuepuka kuunda Grafu mpya kila unapohifadhi kipengee.  Kuendesha Kanuni za Otomatiki kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php:559
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Wezesha Uundaji wa Vipengee vya Mti Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:560
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ikizimwa, Otomatiki ya Cacti haitaunda Kipengee chochote cha Mti kikamilifu.  Hii ni muhimu unaporekebisha mipangilio ya Kifaa au Grafu ili kuepuka kuunda Maingizo mapya ya Mti kila unapohifadhi kipengee.  Kuendesha Kanuni kwa mkono bado kutawezekana."

#: include/global_settings.php:564
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Barua pepe ya Kwenda ya Arifa ya Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:565
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua pepe ya kutuma Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia akaunti ya Barua pepe ya Msimamizi Mkuu wa Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php:571
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Jina la Kutoka la Arifa ya Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:572
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Jina la Barua pepe ya kutumia kwa Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa halijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia Jina chaguo-msingi la Mtumaji la mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php:579
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Barua pepe ya Kutoka ya Arifa ya Uendeshaji Kiotomatiki"

#: include/global_settings.php:580
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua pepe ya kutumia kwa Barua pepe za Arifa za Otomatiki ikiwa haijabainishwa katika kiwango cha Mtandao wa Otomatiki.  Ikiwa sehemu hii, au thamani ya Mtandao wa Otomatiki imeachwa wazi, Cacti itatumia Anwani chaguo-msingi ya Barua pepe ya Mtumaji ya mfumo."

#: include/global_settings.php:586
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Chaguomsingi za Kiolezo cha Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php:592
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Chanzo cha Data cha Jaribio la Kiolezo cha Grafu"

#: include/global_settings.php:593
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Weka tiki kwenye kisanduku hiki ikiwa unataka kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kabla ya kuviunda kwa Violezo vya Grafu vipya na vilivyoletwa hivi karibuni. Kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kukiwezeshwa, ikiwa Chanzo cha Data hakirejeshi data halali, Grafu haitaundwa. Mpangilio huu ni muhimu ikiwa unataka kuwa na Kiolezo cha Kifaa cha jumla zaidi ambacho kinaweza kujumuisha Violezo vingi vya Grafu vinavyoweza kutumika kwa kuchagua kulingana na sifa za Kifaa chenyewe. Kumbuka: Ikiwa una hati inayochukua muda mrefu kama Chanzo cha Data, muda wa kuunda Grafu utaongezeka."

#: include/global_settings.php:598
