msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Ikiwa wakala mkuu na wa akiba wote wanaweza kupokelewa chaguo hili linaruhusu kusambaza maombi yote dhidi ya RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php:2388
