msgstr "Ikiwa saraka hii si tupu, basi RRDfiles zako asili zitahifadhiwa nakala rudufu katika eneo hili."

#: include/global_settings.php:2531
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Spike Kill ya Kundi"

#: include/global_settings.php:2536
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Ratiba ya Uondoaji"

#: include/global_settings.php:2537
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr "Je, ungependa kuondoa vilele mara kwa mara kutoka kwenye grafu zako? Ikiwa ndivyo, chagua marudio hapa chini."

#: include/global_settings.php:2544
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "Mara Moja kwa Siku"

#: include/global_settings.php:2545
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Kila Siku Nyingine"

#: include/global_settings.php:2549
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Muda wa Msingi"

#: include/global_settings.php:2550
msgid "The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Muda wa Msingi wa kuondoa Miinuko ya Ghafla (Spikes).  Kwa mfano, ukitumia '12:00am' na ukachagua mara moja kwa siku, uondoaji wa kundi utaanza takriban usiku wa manane kila siku."

#: include/global_settings.php:2557
msgid "Graph Templates to Spike Kill"
msgstr "Violezo vya Grafu vya kuondoa vilele (Spike Kill)"

#: include/global_settings.php:2559
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Unapofanya uondoaji wa miinuko ya ghafla kwa kundi, violezo vilivyochaguliwa hapa chini pekee ndivyo vitashughulikiwa."

#: include/global_settings.php:2563
msgid "Backup Retention"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Nakala Rudufu"

