#: utilities.php:2351
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Ukurasa wa usaidizi wa kiufundi wa Cacti. Hutumiwa na wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa usaidizi wa kiufundi kusaidia matatizo katika Cacti. Inajumuisha ukaguzi wa matatizo ya kawaida ya usanidi."

#: utilities.php:2355
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Cacti huhifadhi takwimu, hitilafu na jumbe nyingine kulingana na mipangilio ya mfumo.  Taarifa hii inaweza kutumika kutambua matatizo na poller na programu."

#: utilities.php:2359
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Huruhusu Wasimamizi kuvinjari kumbukumbu ya watumiaji. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuchuja na kuhamisha kumbukumbu pia."

#: utilities.php:2363
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Usimamizi wa Kache ya Poller"

#: utilities.php:2366
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Hii ni data inayopitishwa kwa poller kila inapoendeshwa. Data hii kisha inatekelezwa/kutafsiriwa na matokeo yake yanaingizwa kwenye RRDfiles kwa ajili ya kuchora grafu au kwenye hifadhidata kwa ajili ya kuonyesha."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Kache ya Hoja ya Data huhifadhi taarifa zilizokusanywa kutoka kwa aina za ingizo la Hoja ya Data. Thamani kutoka sehemu hizi zinaweza kutumika katika eneo la maandishi la Grafu kwa Maelezo ya Grafu, Lebo za Wima, na GPRINTS pamoja na katika CDEF."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Jenga Upya Kache ya Poller"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Kache ya Poller itaundwa upya ukichagua chaguo hili. Tumia chaguo hili tu iwapo hifadhidata itaanguka ikiwa unakumbana na matatizo baada ya kuanguka na tayari umeendesha zana za kukarabati hifadhidata.  Vinginevyo, ikiwa una matatizo na Kifaa mahususi, hifadhi tena Kifaa hicho ili kujenga upya Kache yake ya Poller.  Pia kuna amri sawa ya mstari wa amri inayopendekezwa kwa mifumo mikubwa."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "KUMBUKA: Kwenye mifumo mikubwa, amri hii inaweza kuchukua dakika kadhaa hadi saa kukamilika na kwa hivyo haipaswi kuendeshwa kutoka kwa UI ya Cacti. Unaweza tu kuendesha 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' kwenye mstari wa amri kwa maelezo zaidi."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Jenga Upya Kache ya Rasilimali"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Unapoendesha Vikusanyaji Data vingi katika Cacti, Cacti itajaribu kudumisha hali ya faili muhimu kwenye Vikusanyaji Data vyote.  Hii inajumuisha faili zote za msingi, zisizo za usakinishaji za tovuti na programu-jalizi.  Unapolazimisha ujenzi upya wa Kache ya Rasilimali, Cacti itafuta Kache ya Rasilimali ya ndani, na kisha kuijenga upya wakati ujao uliopangwa wa poller kuanza.  Hii itasababisha Vikusanyaji Data vyote vya Mbali kukagua upya faili zao za tovuti na programu-jalizi kwa uthabiti."

